    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70066" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νειρός</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lowest,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν χθονὸς νειροῖς μυχοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					896
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηροῖς</span>
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> s. vv. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νειρόν, νηρόν.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νειρή, ἡ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νείαιρα</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, Id.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νειρὴ κοίλη</span>
			 (s. v. l.), but acc. sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεῖραν</span> as Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεῖραν
				ἐς</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλευράν</span> prob. cj. in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				794
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νείαιραν, νείεραν</span> codd.);
			dat. sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νείρᾳ</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1479
			</span></i> (lyr.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νείρει</span> codd.); cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νείαιρα.</span></div>
